From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 07:28:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: g16: Check the board before taking the PMP
 telemetry lease

Gpu::new() registers the GPU cooling device before boot::admit() checks
the board. The cooling device takes a lease on the PMP telemetry provider
named by the node's apple,pmp phandle, and apple_pmp_gpu_get() returns
-EPROBE_DEFER until that provider is online. On a T8132 board that the
backend does not qualify and whose PMP is not running, an enabled GPU node
therefore defers its probe on every retry instead of failing, and the
board check in admit() is never reached.

Check the board first, so that such a board fails with -ENODEV before
the cooling device, the PMP supplier or the driver's own power-domain
hold. The power-domain attach that the driver core performs around every
platform probe is not affected. admit() keeps its own check. Qualified
boards see no change: the same check passes and the same steps follow in
the same order.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit 555b031c574c94b279e97219206348cad2217797)
(cherry picked from commit 9249519af25c30cd59458aad33fcbfe1bd858e67)
(cherry picked from commit 8794703fb30332aa9f8fee195781a5aa14ed1ab4)
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/boot.rs | 10 ++++++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/mod.rs  |  5 ++++-
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/boot.rs b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/boot.rs
index 8420f81bc9..207bb326de 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/boot.rs
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/boot.rs
@@ -470,6 +470,16 @@ impl Orphan {
     }
 }
 
+/// The board gate, before the PMP telemetry lease, the PMP supplier, any power-domain hold or
+/// any firmware-visible access.
+pub(crate) fn qualified_board() -> Result {
+    if glue::board() {
+        Ok(())
+    } else {
+        Err(ENODEV)
+    }
+}
+
 /// Probe-time admission.
 #[inline(never)]
 pub(crate) fn admit(
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/mod.rs b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/mod.rs
index f161b218a0..f3195801fc 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/mod.rs
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/mod.rs
@@ -379,7 +379,10 @@ impl Gpu {
         cfg: &'static Config,
         res: shared_regs::G16Resources,
     ) -> Result<Arc<Gpu>> {
-        // Admission (probe-time checks), then the firmware start to READY.
+        // Admission (probe-time checks), then the firmware start to READY. The board gate
+        // comes first: the cooling device takes a PMP telemetry lease, which an unqualified
+        // board's PMP may never provide.
+        boot::qualified_board()?;
         let power = power::Power::new(dev.as_ref().as_ref())?;
         let admitted = boot::admit(pdev, dev, cfg, res)?;
         let data = admitted.adt.data.clone();
-- 
